  "releaseNotes": "This release keeps User Access Explorer in step with the other tools in the suite. The interface is unchanged: this tool is the one the others were aligned to, so it already had the single compact header, and the same cards, tables and spacing they now share. Nothing about what the tool does has changed. Needs the System Administrator role.",
